LineageOS-SE
============

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/LineageOS-SE, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LOS-SE trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/LineageOS-SE/android.git -b lineage-23.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync -c --force-sync --optimized-fetch --no-tags --no-clone-bundle --prune -j$(nproc --all)
```
